{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"心里像有事催他往前，他却说不清在等什么，连身体都绷着，不知道该往哪儿使力。\",\n      \"key\": \"说不清在等什么\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心就此停住，硬逼自己撑着，又实在想歇一歇，怕真投进去会失去别的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"怕真投进去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"熟悉的感觉让他一时像是知道该往哪儿去，身上先有了往前的劲，可他仍说不清自己想要什么，过去也回不来。\",\n      \"key\": \"熟悉的感觉\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他一遍遍找理由，刚觉得能信了，舍不得又冒出来，连舍不得什么都说不清，为自己非得想透才敢动而难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"非得想透才敢动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留无名的推动力和不知所等，补上身体紧绷、无处使力的缘由，解释召唤般的悬置、无名失落和恍惚，不提前替他确定目标。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去把不行动等同于认可现状的道德判断，保留不甘停住、逼自己撑住、想歇一歇和怕投入后失去别的东西。这也保留了后来行动恐惧逐渐有了具体对象的起点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足遗漏\",\n      \"why\": \"补出熟悉感带来的短暂方向感、过去无法回来，以及身体先于清晰念头被牵向前的变化。只写这些感受对他的影响，不把珠子中的旧场景当成真实往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R3\", \"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把寻找理由、刚觉得能信又被不舍拉回压缩成同一个反复循环。用具体的反复失效代替抽象的确信变陌生，同时保留他不知道自己舍不得什么，以及为非得想透才敢行动而难堪的事实，为后面不再把没想清楚当作无限等待的理由留住前因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f56eaaf-db99-4ec9-979a-baeaa96aa73b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T190413454137Z", "elapsed_seconds": 487.797, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:12:21.261382+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "695681a1025987468aed671a4df8aa8754cbf458e1d2a6592d5ab461c109d41e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T190413454137Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "078ce97f2161573f657e6bf5c628c45230907490351d436a4b868fdd29cb421a"}}}
